[Solution]

<paragraph_0>
The foci of an ellipse are at $(\pm c,0)$ where $c^2=a^2-b^2$. The sum of distances from a point on the ellipse to the foci is $2a$, so in this case $2a=d$ and $a=7$ and $b=5$.
